WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.896 --> 00:00:06.939
"I'll save you!"

2
00:00:13.003 --> 00:00:15.545
The prince cried, diving into the water.

3
00:00:16.885 --> 00:00:20.208
He swam as fast as he could to the drowning woman.

4
00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:24.651
He grabbed her and swam back to shore.

5
00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:32.436
The prince gently placed her on the bank of the lake.

6
00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:37.366
But to his shock, she flew up into the air.

7
00:00:37.386 --> 00:00:41.028
"You naughty man!"

8
00:00:41.449 --> 00:00:42.589
she yelled down at him.

9
00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.371
"Naughty?" the prince said.

10
00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:48.093
"You were crying for help!"

11
00:00:48.113 --> 00:00:52.215
"I wasn't crying," the princess said.

12
00:00:52.235 --> 00:00:54.717
"I was laughing!"

13
00:00:55.858 --> 00:00:59.280
Ellen managed to grab some pinecones from a fir tree.

14
00:01:02.356 --> 00:01:03.957
"Wait till Papa hears about this.

15
00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:07.259
Because of you, I almost floated away!"

16
00:01:11.482 --> 00:01:14.705
She dropped down to the ground and stomped over to the prince.

17
00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:20.328
"Please don't tell him," the prince said.

18
00:01:20.348 --> 00:01:23.871
"You seem fine."

19
00:01:23.891 --> 00:01:27.773
"Why did you pull me out of the water?"

20
00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.014
Ellen asked.

21
00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:32.424
"I thought you were drowning," the prince said.

22
00:01:33.264 --> 00:01:34.205
She frowned at him.

23
00:01:34.225 --> 00:01:36.585
"I might lack gravity.

24
00:01:36.865 --> 00:01:40.406
But it seems you lack something too—brains!"

25
00:01:40.426 --> 00:01:42.427
"It's her!"

26
00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:43.627
the prince thought.

27
00:01:44.447 --> 00:01:48.088
People told stories about a light princess with no gravity.

28
00:01:50.669 --> 00:01:51.990
This must be the woman!

29
00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:54.630
The princess stamped her foot.

30
00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.711
"I want to go back in the water.

31
00:01:58.011 --> 00:02:00.052
You must put me there at once!"

32
00:02:01.248 --> 00:02:03.410
The prince stared into her blue eyes.

33
00:02:06.613 --> 00:02:09.095
"She's beautiful," he thought.

34
00:02:09.715 --> 00:02:12.417
"Did you hear me?"

35
00:02:12.778 --> 00:02:13.758
the princess asked.

36
00:02:13.778 --> 00:02:17.081
"I need you to put me back in the water!"

37
00:02:18.382 --> 00:02:19.984
At last the prince understood.

38
00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:25.508
Without gravity, the princess could not put herself back in the water.

39
00:02:26.309 --> 00:02:27.130
He took her hand.

40
00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.792
They walked to another part of the lake.

41
00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.761
"How should I put you in the water?"

42
00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:35.781
he asked.

43
00:02:36.682 --> 00:02:38.603
"You pulled me out," she said.

44
00:02:38.623 --> 00:02:41.024
"Please figure out how to put me back!"

45
00:02:50.769 --> 00:02:55.672
well." The prince led her onto a nearby rock.

46
00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.742
Then he held her tightly and leaped.

47
00:03:15.007 --> 00:03:16.727
Ellen burst out laughing.

48
00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.871
never fell into the water like that before.

49
00:03:23.891 --> 00:03:26.573
That was so much fun!"

50
00:03:27.893 --> 00:03:29.014
The prince laughed too.

51
00:03:29.034 --> 00:03:34.535
"I fell into the water with the most perfect creature ever!"

52
00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:40.445
And away the two of them went, swimming and
